# Centralized UI Architecture

The project uses a configuration-driven approach for UI components to ensure consistency.

## 1. Forms (FormManager)
Do not write raw HTML forms with custom submit handlers. Use the `FormManager` system.

### Configuration
Define form structure in `src/config/*FormData.ts`:
```typescript
export const myEntityFormData: FormSection = {
  fields: [
    { name: 'fieldName', label: 'Label', type: 'text', required: true },
    // types: text, email, password, number, select, textarea, toggle, checkbox, radio
  ]
};
```

### Rendering
Use `simpleGenericForm.ejs`:
```ejs
<%- include('../../../ui/forms/simpleGenericForm', {
  formId: 'my-form',
  formData: myEntityFormData,
  action: '/path/to/action',
  method: 'POST',
  isAjax: true // Enables FormManager AJAX handling
}) %>
```

## 2. Tables (SelectableTable)
Use `SelectableTable` for lists. It supports sorting, bulk actions, and pagination.

### Configuration
Define columns in `src/config/*TableData.ts`.

### Rendering
Use `selectableTable.ejs`:
```ejs
<%- include('../../../ui/tables/selectableTable', {
  tableConfig: {
    idField: 'id',
    labelField: 'name',
    endpoint: '/api/resource', // For AJAX actions
    // ... actions configuration
  },
  tableData: myTableData,
  items: items
}) %>
```

## 3. Detail Views
Do not hardcode detail pages. Use the centralized Detail View system.

### Configuration
Define in `src/config/detailViewConfig.ts`:
```typescript
export const myEntityDetailViewConfig: DetailViewConfig = {
  fields: [
    { name: 'price', label: 'Price', type: 'currency', format: { currency: { symbol: '€', decimals: 2 } } }
  ],
  layout: 'default'
};
```

### Rendering
Use `genericDetailView.ejs`:
```ejs
<%- include('../../../ui/detailViews/genericDetailView', {
  item: item,
  config: myEntityDetailViewConfig
}) %>
```

## 4. Sub-sections
For nested resources (e.g., Settings > Allergens), use `subSectionConfig.ts`. This drives the `subSection.ejs` view which automatically renders the table, empty state, and actions based on config.
